mdl 1;
-- Bug mendixlabs/mxcli#280 (ako/mxcli#1234), Phase 0 of
-- docs/11-proposals/PROPOSAL_openapi_response_entities.md.
--
-- The reporter imported the Swagger 2.0 Petstore
-- (https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/swagger.json). The OpenAPI importer reads only
-- OpenAPI 3 fields, so a 2.0 document parsed "successfully" into an empty
-- contract: BaseUrl '', request bodies dropped, every response `none`, no warning.
--
-- It is now refused at execution time. `mxcli check` cannot see that, so this is
-- a plain .mdl. The guard is pinned by TestParseSpec_RefusesSwagger2
-- (mdl/openapi/parser_test.go). Run it to see the message:
--
--   mxcli exec mdl-examples/bug-tests/280-openapi-swagger2-refused.mdl
--
-- Expect: "this is a Swagger 2.0 document; only OpenAPI 3 is supported. Convert
-- it to OpenAPI 3 first ...". Before the fix it printed a service whose every
-- operation had `Response: none`.

describe contract operation from openapi 'mdl-examples/openapi-local-specs/petstore-swagger2.json';
